games with you people.

290
00:19:12,200 --> 00:19:14,257
I never play games.

291
00:19:14,340 --> 00:19:15,997
Come on, asleep? Cage?

292
00:19:16,080 --> 00:19:22,017
Anyone who tries to pass through me will

293
00:19:22,100 --> 00:19:24,337
