294
00:19:24,420 --> 00:19:26,717
I love it when she uses that line.

295
00:19:26,800 --> 00:19:31,780
Captain Heena's the essence of I'm
done spending time behind bars! No!

296
00:19:32,120 --> 00:19:33,020
Second gear!

297
00:19:38,920 --> 00:19:41,140
So fast, I couldn't follow.

298
00:19:42,300 --> 00:19:43,130
