299
00:19:43,520 --> 00:19:45,579
You're not the only one who failed.

300
00:19:45,740 --> 00:19:49,440
Captain Hina's truly taken us
captive now, both body and soul.

301
00:19:49,820 --> 00:19:50,760
Just die!

302
00:20:11,080 --> 00:20:13,256
Why do they all have to be so strong?

303
00:20:20,420 --> 00:20:21,250
Ha!

304
00:20:21,333 --> 00:20:22,202
Look at him go.

305
00:20:22,480 --> 00:20:25,997
He's as high-spirited
as ever I see. Oh, yeah.

306
00:20:26,080 --> 00:20:30,680
I can cut off his shadow again and
then plant it inside the new zombie.

307
00:20:34,120 --> 00:20:37,180
Rise my zombie soldiers, it's time!

308
00:20:45,420 --> 00:20:50,080
Now are you listening good capture
Straw Hat and bring them to me.

309
00:20:50,280 --> 00:20:51,360
I want him alive

310
00:20:52,780 --> 00:20:55,380
I don't want to deal with that creep now

311
