There are more of them! Of course!

313
00:21:20,920 --> 00:21:22,337
We are standing on a battlefield.

314
00:21:22,420 --> 00:21:24,997
I've got plenty of fresh
corpses scattered about

315
00:21:25,080 --> 00:21:28,200
to pick and choose from
Capture Straw Hat Luffy!

316
00:21:28,340 --> 00:21:30,437
He's the one that caused that jailbreak!

317
00:21:30,520 --> 00:21:32,140
That's right, keep going!

318
00:21:33,080 --> 00:21:36,139
This should be enough
officers to keep the kid busy.

319
00:21:36,360 --> 00:21:39,184
He can't keep bouncing
around like that forever.

320
00:21:43,140 --> 00:21:43,970
Luffy...

321
00:22:03,080 --> 00:22:05,580
Luffy, stay back!

322
00:22:21,280 --> 00:22:26,357
What the hell do you think you're doing
you became a pirate because I wanted to!

323
00:22:26,440 --> 00:22:28,937
You only went to sea
because you were following

324
00:22:29,020 --> 00:22:32,317
me but I've got my own damn
life without you in it!

325
00:22:32,400 --> 00:22:35,740
I've already got enough of my own friends!

326
00:22:37,780 --> 00:22:39,880
Ace You get it?

327
00:22:40,180 --> 00:22:45,300
I want you to stay the hell away
from me You really want to save me?

328
00:22:45,500 --> 00:22:47,020
A scrawny wimp like you?

329
00:22:47,440 --> 00:22:50,969
What makes you think I'd even
want something like that, huh?

330
