Did I just hear them say
that they're brothers?

343
00:23:44,140 --> 00:23:45,960
So then he's also Roger's son?

344
00:23:46,140 --> 00:23:50,157
But both of these says Paris were dead
when he was born That can't be possible,

345
00:23:50,240 --> 00:23:51,070
can't it?

346
