You two brothers are both damn fools.

392
00:26:19,540 --> 00:26:21,340
Dirt gear!

393
00:26:28,340 --> 00:26:30,620
Now come, come!

394
00:26:32,260 --> 00:26:33,660
Dying!

395
00:26:34,440 --> 00:26:35,520
Cipher!

396
00:26:44,640 --> 00:26:46,040
Release!

397
00:26:49,780 --> 00:26:52,220
Say whatever means stuff you want!

398
00:26:52,520 --> 00:26:54,460
